 Rodrigo. ¿Es la primera vez que vienes a Guadalajara?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"No, he venido varias veces. La primera vez fue en 2019, con mi universidad."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"¡Hablas muy bien! ¿Cuántos idiomas hablas?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"Tres: inglés, español y un poco de francés. El español es el idioma que más me gusta."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"¿Y ya has probado la birria?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"¡Claro! Pero todavía no he ido a un partido de las Chivas."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Yo he ido muchas veces. Si quieres, el domingo vamos juntos."},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"¡Me encantaría! He conocido a gente muy simpática aquí."}]},"question":"Is it Emma’s first time in Guadalajara?","options":["No, she has been there several times","Yes, she arrived this week","Yes, she came with her university","No, she lives in Guadalajara"]},"answer":"No, she has been there several times","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Emma says “No, he venido varias veces. La primera vez fue en 2019, con mi universidad.”","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l03-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l03","position":8,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u1-fiesta","setting":"At a party in Guadalajara, Rodrigo meets Emma, a student from Chicago.","speakers":[{"name":"Rodrigo","voice":"a"},{"name":"Emma","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Hola, soy Rodrigo. ¿Es la primera vez que vienes a Guadalajara?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"No, he venido varias veces. La primera vez fue en 2019, con mi universidad."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"¡Hablas muy bien! ¿Cuántos idiomas hablas?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"Tres: inglés, español y un poco de francés. El español es el idioma que más me gusta."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"¿Y ya has probado la birria?"},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"¡Claro! Pero todavía no he ido a un partido de las Chivas."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Yo he ido muchas veces. Si quieres, el domingo vamos juntos."},{"speaker":"Emma","text":"¡Me encantaría! He conocido a gente muy simpática aquí."}]},"question":"What hasn’t Emma done yet in Guadalajara?","options":["Gone to a Chivas football match","Tried birria","Met friendly people","Spoken Spanish"]},"answer":"Gone to a Chivas football match","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"She says she has tried birria (“¡Claro!”), “pero todavía no he ido a un partido de las Chivas”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l03-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l03","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"I have met a lot of people here."},"answer":"He conocido a mucha gente aquí.","accepted_answers":["Aquí he conocido a mucha gente.","He conocido a mucha gente acá.","Acá he conocido a mucha gente.","He conocido mucha gente aquí.","Conocí a mucha gente aquí.","Aquí conocí a mucha gente."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-he-conocido"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l03-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l03","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Ya has probado la comida mexicana?","translation":"Answer with «Sí, ya la he probado…» or «No, todavía no»."},"answer":"Sí, ya la he probado.","accepted_answers":["Sí, ya la he probado","Sí, ya he probado la comida mexicana.","Sí, la he probado varias veces.","Sí, ya la he probado varias veces.","No, todavía no.","Todavía no.","No, todavía no la he probado.","Sí, ya la probé."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-he-probado"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l04-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l04","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “inolvidable” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"inolvidable","options":["unforgettable","unbelievable","unforgivable","unusual"]},"answer":"unforgettable","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-inolvidable"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l04-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l04","position":2,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “me sorprendió” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"me sorprendió","options":["it surprised me","I liked it","it scared me","I remembered it"]},"answer":"it surprised me","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-me-sorprendio"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l04-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"He estado en Oaxaca varias veces; la primera vez ___ en 2023.","translation":"I’ve been to Oaxaca several times; the first time I went in 2023.","options":["fui","he ido","voy","iba"]},"answer":"fui","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"With a specific date (en 2023), use the preterite: fui. He ido would talk about the experience without a date.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-varias-veces"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l04-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l04","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"El año pasado ___ un viaje inolvidable a Perú.","translation":"Last year I took an unforgettable trip to Peru.","options":["hice","he hecho","hago","hacer"]},"answer":"hice","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El año pasado is a finished time, so Spanish uses the preterite hice, not he hecho.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-he-hecho","es-inolvidable"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l04-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l04","position":5,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar