ntaría! He conocido a gente muy simpática aquí."}]},"question":"What does Rodrigo suggest to Emma?","options":["Going to a Chivas match together on Sunday","Trying birria on Sunday","Visiting his university","Speaking French together"]},"answer":"Going to a Chivas match together on Sunday","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rodrigo says “Yo he ido muchas veces. Si quieres, el domingo vamos juntos”, and Emma answers “¡Me encantaría!”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l05-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l05","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"I have never been to Japan, but it is my dream."},"answer":"Nunca he estado en Japón, pero es mi sueño.","accepted_answers":["Jamás he estado en Japón, pero es mi sueño.","Nunca he estado en Japón pero es mi sueño.","No he estado nunca en Japón, pero es mi sueño.","Nunca he ido a Japón, pero es mi sueño.","Nunca estuve en Japón, pero es mi sueño."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-sueno","es-jamas"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-l05-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-l05","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Cuál es tu sueño?","translation":"Say what your dream is (Mi sueño es + infinitive)."},"answer":"Mi sueño es viajar por todo el mundo.","accepted_answers":["Mi sueño es viajar por todo el mundo","Mi sueño es viajar.","Mi sueño es vivir en otro país.","Mi sueño es ir a Japón.","Mi sueño es hablar español muy bien.","Mi sueño es conocer México.","Mi sueño es ver el mar."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-sueno"]},{"id":"es-b1-u01-listen-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u01-listen","position":1,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audio