t at the end.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-la-carrera"]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-rev2-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-rev2","position":8,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “renunciar” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"renunciar","options":["to resign","the deadline","I hope (that)","the degree (course)"]},"answer":"to resign","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-renunciar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-rev2-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-rev2","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"the client"},"answer":"el cliente","accepted_answers":["la cliente","la clienta"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-cliente"]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-rev2","position":10,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Si no me dan el ascenso, voy a ___.","translation":"If they don’t give me the promotion, I’m going to quit.","options":["renunciar","contratar","solicitar","llegar"]},"answer":"renunciar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Renunciar is to resign or quit a job (renunciar a un puesto). Contratar is what the company does when it hires you.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-renunciar","es-el-ascenso"]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-l05-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-l05","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “la beca” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"la beca","options":["the scholarship","the degree (course)","the internship","the deadline"]},"answer":"the scholarship","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-la-beca"]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-l05-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-l05","position":2,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u5-beca","setting":"Two university students in Lima talk about a scholarship.","speakers":[{"name":"Carmen","voice":"a"},{"name":"Andrés","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Andrés, ¿ya viste la beca para estudiar un año en Madrid?"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Sí, ¡quiero solicitarla! Pero no sé qué hay que hacer."},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Es necesario que tengas buenas notas y que escribas una carta en español y en inglés."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"¿Y cuál es la fecha límite?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"El 30 de abril. Es importante que mandes todo antes, así que tienes tres semanas."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Es poco tiempo… ¿Me ayudas con la carta en inglés?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Claro. ¡Espero que te den la beca!"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Gracias. Si me la dan, ¡te invito a Madrid!"}]},"question":"What does Andrés want to do?","options":["Apply for a scholarship to study in Madrid for a year","Get a job in Madrid","Study English in Lima","Visit Carmen in Madrid"]},"answer":"Apply for a scholarship to study in Madrid for a year","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Carmen asks about “la beca para estudiar un año en Madrid” and Andrés answers “¡quiero solicitarla!”: la = la beca.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-l05-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-l05","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u5-beca","setting":"Two university students in Lima talk about a scholarship.","speakers":[{"name":"Carmen","voice":"a"},{"name":"Andrés","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Andrés, ¿ya viste la beca para estudiar un año en Madrid?"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Sí, ¡quiero solicitarla! Pero no sé qué hay que hacer."},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Es necesario que tengas buenas notas y que escribas una carta en español y en inglés."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"¿Y cuál es la fecha límite?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"El 30 de abril. Es importante que mandes todo antes, así que tienes tres semanas."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Es poco tiempo… ¿Me ayudas con la carta en inglés?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Claro. ¡Espero que te den la beca!"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Gracias. Si me la dan, ¡te invito a Madrid!"}]},"question":"What is necessary for the scholarship?","options":["Good grades and a letter in Spanish and English","A job interview in English","Two years of work experience","A letter from a teacher"]},"answer":"Good grades and a letter in Spanish and English","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Carmen says “Es necesario que tengas buenas notas y que escribas una carta en español y en inglés”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u05-l05-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u05-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u5-beca","setting":"Two university students in Lima talk about a scholarship.","speakers":[{"name":"Carmen","voice":"a"},{"name":"Andrés","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Andrés, ¿ya viste la beca para estudiar un año en Madrid?"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Sí, ¡quiero solicitarla! Pero no sé qué hay que hacer."},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Es necesario que tengas buenas notas y que escribas una carta en español y en inglés."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"¿Y cuál es la fecha límite?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"El 30 de abril. Es importante que mandes todo antes, así que tienes tres semanas."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Es poco tiempo… ¿Me ayudas con la carta en inglés?"},{"speaker":"Carmen","text":"Claro. ¡Espero que te den la beca!"},{"