answer":"esté","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Contento goes with estar, and after es importante que you need the subjunctive of estar: esté (with an accent). Sea is the subjunctive of ser.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-es-importante-que","es-el-cliente"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “te recomiendo que” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"te recomiendo que","options":["I recommend that you","I remember that you","I hope that you","I promise you that"]},"answer":"I recommend that you","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-te-recomiendo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Te recomiendo que ___ el museo de Puebla.","translation":"I recommend that you visit the museum in Puebla.","options":["visites","visitar","visitas"]},"answer":"visites","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"After te recomiendo que, the verb is in the subjunctive. Visitar is a regular -ar verb: visito → visite, visites (tú).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-te-recomiendo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":3,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Te aconsejo que lleves una chaqueta.","options":["Te aconsejo que lleves una chaqueta.","Te aconsejo que lleve una chaqueta.","Te aconsejo llevar una chaqueta."]},"answer":"Te aconsejo que lleves una chaqueta.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-te-aconsejo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":4,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary