gel on Reforma avenue in Mexico City.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-el-monumento"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Put the words in order","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Te","recomiendo","que","vayas","a","Oaxaca","en","noviembre"],"translation":"I recommend that you go to Oaxaca in November."},"answer":"Te recomiendo que vayas a Oaxaca en noviembre.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["es-te-recomiendo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"I advise you to visit the monuments in the morning."},"answer":"Te aconsejo que visites los monumentos por la mañana.","accepted_answers":["Te aconsejo que visites los monumentos en la mañana.","Te aconsejo visitar los monumentos por la mañana.","Por la mañana te aconsejo que visites los monumentos.","Le aconsejo que visite los monumentos por la mañana."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-te-aconsejo-que","es-el-monumento"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l01-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l01","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Qué destino me recomiendas en México?","translation":"Recommend that your friend goes to Oaxaca (start with «Te recomiendo que»)."},"answer":"Te recomiendo que vayas a Oaxaca.","accepted_answers":["Te recomiendo que vayas a Oaxaca","Te recomiendo que visites Oaxaca.","Te recomiendo que vayas a Oaxaca en noviembre.","Te recomiendo que conozcas Oaxaca."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-te-recomiendo-que","es-el-destino"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l02-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l02","position"