nda pequeña sin saludar: un «buenos días» es suficiente.","No regatees en los restaurantes ni en las tiendas grandes; en los mercados, a veces sí puedes.","No tomes fotos de la gente sin preguntar primero.","No llegues a una fiesta en casa a la hora exacta: lo normal es llegar un poco más tarde.","Y si alguien te invita a comer, no digas que no a todo: prueba un poco de cada plato."]},"question":"Where shouldn’t you haggle?","options":["In restaurants and big shops","In markets","Anywhere in Mexico","In small shops only"]},"answer":"In restaurants and big shops","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The post says “No regatees en los restaurantes ni en las tiendas grandes; en los mercados, a veces sí puedes”. No regatees is a negative command: no + subjunctive.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l03-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l03","position":7,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"saludar","right":"to greet"},{"left":"educado","right":"polite"},{"left":"grosero","right":"rude"},{"left":"regatear","right":"to haggle"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-saludar","es-educado","es-grosero","es-regatear"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l03-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l03","position":8,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"En una tienda pequeña es ___ no saludar.","translation":"In a small shop it’s rude not to say hello.","options":["grosero","educado","barato","tímido"]},"answer":"grosero","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Grosero is rude. Not saying hello when you go into a small shop is considered rude in Mexico and in many other countries.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-grosero","es-saludar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u06-l03-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u06-l03","position":9,"