mended_seconds":12,"words":["es-el-estres"]},{"id":"es-b1-u07-l03-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u07-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Cuanto más café tomas, ___ duermes.","translation":"The more coffee you drink, the worse you sleep.","options":["peor","mejor","muy"]},"answer":"peor","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"After cuanto más… the second part starts with más, menos, mejor or peor. More coffee means worse sleep: peor duermes.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-cuanto-mas"]},{"id":"es-b1-u07-l03-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u07-l03","position":3,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Cuanto más duermo, mejor me siento.","options":["Cuanto más duermo, mejor me siento.","Cuanto más duermo, peor me siento.","Cuando duermo, me siento mejor."]},"answer":"Cuanto más duermo, mejor me siento.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-cuanto-mas"]},{"id":"es-b1-u07-l03-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u07-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u7-dormir","document":"description","setting":"A short article from a health website.","title":"Cómo dormir mejor","lines":["Muchas personas duermen poco y están agotadas todo el día.","Dormir bien es muy importante para la salud, y no es tan difícil.","Primero, no tomes café después de las cinco de la tarde.","También es mejor cenar temprano y poco.","Apaga el celular una hora antes de dormir: cuanto más miras la pantalla, peor duermes.","Y si tienes mucho estrés, escribe tus problemas en un cuaderno antes de acostarte.","Cuanto más tranquila es tu noche, mejor duermes."]},"question":"According to the article, when should you stop drinking coffee?","options":["After five in the afternoon","After lunch","One hour before bed","After dinner"]},"answer":"After five in the afternoon","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The article says “no tomes café después de las cinco de la tarde”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u07-l03-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u07-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u7-dormir","document":"description","setting":"A short article from a health website.","title":"Cómo dormir mejor","lines":["Muchas personas duermen poco y están agotadas todo el día.","Dormir bien es muy importante para la salud, y no es tan difícil.","Primero, no tomes café después de las cinco de la tarde.","También es mejor cenar temprano y poco.","Apaga el celular una hora antes de dormir: cuanto más miras la pantalla, peor duermes.","Y si tienes mucho estrés, escribe tus problemas en un cuaderno antes de acostarte.","Cuanto más tranquila es tu noche, mejor duermes."]},"question":"Why should you switch off your phone an hour before bed?","options":["Because the more you look at the screen, the worse you sleep","Because the light wakes up the family","Because messages cause stress","Because it uses a lot of battery"]},"answer":"Because the more you look at the screen, the worse you sleep","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"It says “cuanto más miras la pantalla, peor duermes”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u07-l03-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u07-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u7-dormir","document":"description","setting":"A short article from a health website.","title":"Cómo dormir mejor","lines":["Muchas personas duermen poco y están agotadas todo el día.","Dormir bien es muy impor