"options":["Tenemos que proteger la naturaleza.","Tenemos que proteger el bosque.","Queremos proteger la naturaleza.","Tenemos que caminar en la naturaleza."]},"answer":"Tenemos que proteger la naturaleza.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-proteger","es-la-naturaleza"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l01-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l01","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-xalapa","document":"post","setting":"Paula writes a post about nature in her city.","from":"Paula","lines":["Vivo en Xalapa, una ciudad de Veracruz con mucha naturaleza.","Cerca de mi casa hay un bosque muy bonito, donde me gusta caminar los domingos.","Sin embargo, cada año hace más calor y llueve menos.","Creo que es por el cambio climático.","También los carros y las fábricas contaminan el aire de la ciudad.","Por eso, desde hace un año voy al trabajo en bicicleta.","Es poco, pero todos podemos hacer algo para proteger el medio ambiente."]},"question":"Why does Paula think it is hotter every year?","options":["Because of climate change","Because of the factories","Because there is no forest","Because it rains a lot"]},"answer":"Because of climate change","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula writes “cada año hace más calor y llueve menos. Creo que es por el cambio climático”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l01-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l01","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-xalapa","document":"post","setting":"Paula writes a post about nature in her city.","from":"Paula","lines":["Vivo en Xalapa, una ciudad de Veracruz con mucha naturaleza.","Cerca de mi casa hay un bosque muy bonito, donde me gusta caminar los domingos.","Sin embargo, cada año hace más calor y llueve menos.","Creo que es por el cambio climático.","También los carros y las fábricas contaminan el aire de la ciudad.","Por eso, desde hace un año voy al trabajo en bicicleta.","Es poco, pero todos podemos hacer algo para proteger el medio ambiente."]},"question":"What does Paula do to help the environment?","options":["She cycles to work","She walks in the forest every day","She sold her car last year","She works in a factory"]},"answer":"She cycles to work","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"She writes “desde hace un año voy al trabajo en bicicleta”, because cars and factories pollute the air.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l01-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l01","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Put the words in order","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["El","cambio","climático","es","un","problema","de","todos"],"translation":"Climate change is everyone’s problem."},"answer":"El cambio climático es un problema de todos.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["es-el-cambio-climatico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l01-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l01","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Pollution is a big problem in my city."},"answer":"La contaminación es un gran problema en mi ciudad.","accepted_answers":["La contaminación es un problema grande en mi ciudad.","La contaminación es un gran problema en mi ciudad"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-la-contaminacion"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l01-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l01","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Qué haces para proteger el medio ambiente?","translation":"Say one thing you do (e.g. you go to work by bike: voy al trabajo en bicicleta)."},"answer":"Voy al trabajo en bicicleta.","accepted_answers":["Voy en bicicleta al trabajo.","Voy al trabajo en bicicleta para proteger el medio ambiente.","Para proteger el medio ambiente, voy al trabajo en bicicleta.","Camino al trabajo.","Voy al trabajo en autobús.","Voy al trabajo en metro."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-proteger","es-el-medio-ambiente"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “el reciclaje” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"el reciclaje","options":["recycling","trash","plastic","energy"]},"answer":"recycling","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-el-reciclaje"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":2,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"reciclar","right":"to recycle"},{"left":"la basura","right":"trash"},{"left":"el plástico","right":"plastic"},{"left":"el reciclaje","right":"recycling"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-reciclar","es-la-basura","es-el-plastico","es-el-reciclaje"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"En mi casa se ___ las botellas de plástico.","translation":"At home, plastic bottles are recycled.","options":["reciclan","recicla","reciclaje","reciclar"]},"answer":"reciclan","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"With se, the verb agrees with the noun: las botellas is plural, so se reciclan. Se recicla goes with a singular noun (se recicla el papel).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-reciclar","es-el-plastico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Acá ___ separa la basura en tres bolsas.","translation":"Here trash is separated into three bags.","options":["se","es","le","lo"]},"answer":"se","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Se + verb says what is done without saying who does it: se separa la basura (trash is separated).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-la-basura"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Se reciclan el papel y el vidrio.","options":["Se reciclan el papel y el vidrio.","Se reciclan el papel y el plástico.","Se recicla el plástico.","No se reciclan el papel ni el vidrio."]},"answer":"Se reciclan el papel y el vidrio.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-reciclar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-radio","setting":"A radio presenter in Monterrey talks to a man who organizes recycling in his neighborhood.","speakers":[{"name":"Diana","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rodrigo","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Diana","text":"Buenos días, Monterrey. Hoy hablamos del reciclaje. Está con nosotros Rodrigo, que organiza el reciclaje en su barrio."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Gracias, Diana. En mi barrio se recicla mucho más que hace dos años."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y cómo se hace? ¿Qué se recicla?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Se separa la basura en casa: el papel, el vidrio y el plástico van en bolsas diferentes."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y quién lleva todo eso a reciclar?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Los sábados, los vecinos llevan las bolsas a la plaza y un camión se las lleva."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Qué es lo más difícil?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Las fiestas. Se usa mucho plástico y la gente no separa nada. Tenemos que reciclar también ese día."}]},"question":"How is trash separated in Rodrigo’s neighborhood?","options":["At home, in different bags for paper, glass and plastic","At the recycling center, by a truck driver","In the square, only on Sundays","It isn’t separated at all"]},"answer":"At home, in different bags for paper, glass and plastic","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rodrigo says “Se separa la basura en casa: el papel, el vidrio y el plástico van en bolsas diferentes”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-radio","setting":"A radio presenter in Monterrey talks to a man who organizes recycling in his neighborhood.","speakers":[{"name":"Diana","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rodrigo","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Diana","text":"Buenos días, Monterrey. Hoy hablamos del reciclaje. Está con nosotros Rodrigo, que organiza el reciclaje en su barrio."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Gracias, Diana. En mi barrio se recicla mucho más que hace dos años."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y cómo se hace? ¿Qué se recicla?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Se separa la basura en casa: el papel, el vidrio y el plástico van en bolsas diferentes."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y quién lleva todo eso a reciclar?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Los sábados, los vecinos llevan las bolsas a la plaza y un camión se las lleva."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Qué es lo más difícil?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Las fiestas. Se usa mucho plástico y la gente no separa nada. Tenemos que reciclar también ese día."}]},"question":"According to Rodrigo, what is the most difficult moment for recycling?","options":["Parties, because a lot of plastic is used and nobody separates it","Saturdays, because the truck is late","Winter, because it rains","Mondays, because there is too much paper"]},"answer":"Parties, because a lot of plastic is used and nobody separates it","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"He answers “Las fiestas. Se usa mucho plástico y la gente no separa nada”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Put the words in order","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["En","mi","barrio","se","recicla","mucho","más","que","antes"],"translation":"People recycle much more than before in my neighborhood."},"answer":"En mi barrio se recicla mucho más que antes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["es-reciclar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Plastic is recycled here."},"answer":"Acá el plástico se recicla.","accepted_answers":["Acá se recicla el plástico.","Se recicla el plástico acá.","El plástico se recicla acá.","Aquí se recicla el plástico.","Acá el plástico se recicla."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-reciclar","es-el-plastico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l02-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l02","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Qué se recicla en tu casa?","translation":"Say what is recycled at home (e.g. paper and plastic: se reciclan el papel y el plástico)."},"answer":"En mi casa se reciclan el papel y el plástico.","accepted_answers":["Se reciclan el papel y el plástico.","En mi casa se recicla el papel y el plástico.","Se recicla el papel y el plástico.","En mi casa se recicla el plástico.","Se recicla el plástico.","Se recicla el papel.","Se recicla el vidrio.","En mi casa se recicla el papel, el vidrio y el plástico.","En mi casa no se recicla nada."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-reciclar","es-el-plastico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev1-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev1","position":1,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"En mi casa se ___ las botellas de plástico.","translation":"At home, plastic bottles are recycled.","options":["reciclan","recicla","reciclaje","reciclar"]},"answer":"reciclan","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"With se, the verb agrees with the noun: las botellas is plural, so se reciclan. Se recicla goes with a singular noun (se recicla el papel).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-reciclar","es-el-plastico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev1-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev1","position":2,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"reciclar","right":"to recycle"},{"left":"el medio ambiente","right":"the environment"},{"left":"el cambio climático","right":"climate change"},{"left":"el reciclaje","right":"recycling"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-reciclar","es-el-medio-ambiente","es-el-cambio-climatico","es-el-reciclaje"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev1-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev1","position":3,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"el medio ambiente","options":["el medio ambiente","el bosque","proteger","la contaminación"]},"answer":"el medio ambiente","accepted_answers":