slate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Pollution is a big problem in my city."},"answer":"La contaminación es un gran problema en mi ciudad.","accepted_answers":["La contaminación es un problema grande en mi ciudad.","La contaminación es un gran problema en mi ciudad"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-la-contaminacion"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev1-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev1","position":9,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “la naturaleza” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"la naturaleza","options":["nature","to use up","recycling","to recycle"]},"answer":"nature","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-la-naturaleza"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev1-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev1","position":10,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “reciclar” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"reciclar","options":["to recycle","recycling","to protect","trash"]},"answer":"to recycle","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-reciclar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “el voluntario” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"el voluntario","options":["volunteer","neighbor","boss","witness"]},"answer":"volunteer","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-el-voluntario"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":2,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"el voluntario","right":"volunteer"},{"left":"la comunidad","right":"community"},{"left":"la energía","right":"energy"},{"left":"gastar","right":"to use up"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-voluntario","es-la-comunidad","es-la-energia","es-gastar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"El mercado fue ___ por los vecinos del barrio.","translation":"The market was created by the people of the neighborhood.","options":["creado","creada","creados","creadas"]},"answer":"creado","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"In the passive, the participle agrees with the subject: el mercado is masculine singular, so fue creado. La plaza fue creada; los mercados fueron creados.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-la-comunidad"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Las calles ___ limpiadas por los voluntarios.","translation":"The streets were cleaned by the volunteers.","options":["fueron","fue","son","era"]},"answer":"fueron","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Las calles is plural, so the preterite of ser is fueron (were): fueron limpiadas. Fue is singular: la calle fue limpiada.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-el-voluntario"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":5,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"En casa ___ menos energía que antes.","translation":"At home we use less energy than before.","options":["gastamos","gastar","reciclar","contaminar"]},"answer":"gastamos","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Gastar is used for money, but also for water and energy: gastar energía = to use energy. We: gastamos.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-gastar","es-la-energia"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"El bosque fue limpiado por los voluntarios.","options":["El bosque fue limpiado por los voluntarios.","El bosque fue limpiado por los vecinos.","El bosque fue limpiado por los niños.","La plaza fue limpiada por los voluntarios."]},"answer":"El bosque fue limpiado por los voluntarios.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-el-bosque","es-el-voluntario"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-jornada","document":"sign","setting":"A poster at a community center in Puebla.","lines":["¡El bosque necesita voluntarios!","El sábado 14 de marzo, de 8 a 13 horas, vamos a limpiar el bosque del barrio.","El año pasado, el bosque fue limpiado por 200 voluntarios y se plantaron 300 árboles.","Este año se van a plantar 500 árboles más.","Puede venir toda la familia: los niños van con sus papás.","Por favor, trae tu botella de agua: en el bosque no se usa plástico.","Organiza la comunidad del barrio. ¡Te esperamos!"]},"question":"What happened in the forest last year?","options":["Volunteers cleaned it and planted trees","There was a big fire","A new market was opened","Nobody came to help"]},"answer":"Volunteers cleaned it and planted trees","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The poster says “El año pasado, el bosque fue limpiado por 200 voluntarios y se plantaron 300 árboles”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":8,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-jornada","document":"sign","setting":"A poster at a community center in Puebla.","lines":["¡El bosque necesita voluntarios!","El sábado 14 de marzo, de 8 a 13 horas, vamos a limpiar el bosque del barrio.","El año pasado, el bosque fue limpiado por 200 voluntarios y se plantaron 300 árboles.","Este año se van a plantar 500 árboles más.","Puede venir toda la familia: los niños van con sus papás.","Por favor, trae tu botella de agua: en el bosque no se usa plástico.","Organiza la comunidad del barrio. ¡Te esperamos!"]},"question":"What are people asked to bring, and why?","options":["Their own bottle of water, because no plastic is used in the forest","Plastic bags, to collect the trash","Food for the volunteers","A tree, because there are no trees"]},"answer":"Their own bottle of water, because no plastic is used in the forest","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The poster says “Por favor, trae tu botella de agua: en el bosque no se usa plástico”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"The street was cleaned by the community."},"answer":"La calle fue limpiada por la comunidad.","accepted_answers":["La comunidad limpió la calle.","La calle fue limpiada por la comunidad"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-la-comunidad"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l03-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l03","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"We have to use less energy."},"answer":"Tenemos que gastar menos energía.","accepted_answers":["Tenemos que usar menos energía.","Hay que gastar menos energía.","Debemos gastar menos energía."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-gastar","es-la-energia"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “dudo que” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"dudo que","options":["I doubt that","I don’t think that","I think that","I hope that"]},"answer":"I doubt that","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-dudo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"No creo que ___ la fábrica.","translation":"I don’t think it’s the factory.","options":["sea","es","era","está"]},"answer":"sea","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"No creo que is followed by the subjunctive: sea (from ser). With creo que, use the indicative: creo que es la fábrica.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-no-creo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Creo que la fábrica ___ el agua del río.","translation":"I think the factory pollutes the river water.","options":["contamina","contamine","contaminar","contaminación"]},"answer":"contamina","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Creo que states something as true, so it takes the indicative: contamina. With no creo que you would use the subjunctive: no creo que la fábrica contamine el agua.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-contaminar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Dudo que la ciudad ___ algo pronto.","translation":"I doubt the city will do anything soon.","options":["haga","hace","hacer","hizo"]},"answer":"haga","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dudo que + subjunctive: haga (from hacer). In English it often translates with “will”: I doubt it will do anything.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-dudo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"No creo que sea la fábrica.","options":["No creo que sea la fábrica.","Creo que es la fábrica.","No creo que sea el agua.","Dudo que sea la fábrica."]},"answer":"No creo que sea la fábrica.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-no-creo-que","es-dudo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-vecinos","setting":"Two neighbors in Mexico City talk about the river near their street.","speakers":[{"name":"Valeria","voice":"a"},{"name":"Andrés","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Oye, Andrés, ¿viste el río? Hay mucha basura otra vez."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Sí, ¡qué mal! Creo que la fábrica de la esquina contamina el agua."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"No sé, no creo que sea la fábrica. Creo que es la basura de las calles: cuando llueve, llega al río."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Puede ser. Pero dudo que la ciudad haga algo pronto."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Entonces, ¿por qué no vamos a limpiar el río el domingo con los vecinos?"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Me parece bien. Y la calle necesita más botes de basura."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Perfecto. Yo hablo con los vecinos de la esquina."}]},"question":"What does Valeria think is polluting the river?","options":["Trash from the streets that the rain carries to the river","The factory on the corner","The neighbors on the corner","A truck from the city"]},"answer":"Trash from the streets that the rain carries to the river","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Valeria says “no creo que sea la fábrica. Creo que es la basura de las calles: cuando llueve, llega al río”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-vecinos","setting":"Two neighbors in Mexico City talk about the river near their street.","speakers":[{"name":"Valeria","voice":"a"},{"name":"Andrés","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Oye, Andrés, ¿viste el río? Hay mucha basura otra vez."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Sí, ¡qué mal! Creo que la fábrica de la esquina contamina el agua."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"No sé, no creo que sea la fábrica. Creo que es la basura de las calles: cuando llueve, llega al río."},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Puede ser. Pero dudo que la ciudad haga algo pronto."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Entonces, ¿por qué no vamos a limpiar el río el domingo con los vecinos?"},{"speaker":"Andrés","text":"Me parece bien. Y la calle necesita más botes de basura."},{"speaker":"Valeria","text":"Perfecto. Yo hablo con los vecinos de la esquina."}]},"question":"What does Andrés doubt?","options":["That the city will do something soon","That the factory pollutes the water","That the neighbors will help","That the river is dirty"]},"answer":"That the city will do something soon","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Andrés says “dudo que la ciudad haga algo pronto”: dudo que + subjunctive (haga).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":8,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-mercado","document":"description","setting":"An article in a local newspaper in Bogotá.","lines":["En un barrio de Bogotá hay un mercado diferente: acá no se usa plástico.","El mercado fue creado hace tres años por los vecinos del barrio.","No se venden bolsas: cada cliente trae sus bolsas y sus botellas.","El café, el pan y el queso se venden sin plástico.","Los vecinos están contentos: ahora hay mucha menos basura en el barrio.","Sin embargo, para algunos clientes, los precios son altos.","«No creo que sea más caro. Solo es diferente», dice Marta, una vecina.","Ahora la comunidad quiere abrir dos mercados más en la ciudad."]},"question":"What does Marta think about the prices of the market?","options":["She doesn’t think it is more expensive","She thinks the prices are too high","She doesn’t know the prices","She thinks it is cheaper than other markets"]},"answer":"She doesn’t think it is more expensive","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Marta says “No creo que sea más caro. Solo es diferente”. It is some customers who think the prices are high.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"I don’t think it’s a big problem."},"answer":"No creo que sea un gran problema.","accepted_answers":["No creo que sea un problema grande.","No creo que sea un gran problema"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-no-creo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l04-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l04","position":10,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Crees que la gente recicla lo suficiente?","translation":"Answer with «no creo que» or «dudo que» + subjunctive (e.g. no creo que recicle lo suficiente)."},"answer":"No creo que recicle lo suficiente.","accepted_answers":["No, no creo que recicle lo suficiente.","Dudo que recicle lo suficiente.","No, dudo que recicle lo suficiente.","No creo que la gente recicle lo suficiente.","Dudo que la gente recicle lo suficiente.","Sí, creo que recicla lo suficiente.","Creo que recicla lo suficiente."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-no-creo-que","es-dudo-que","es-reciclar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":1,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"En casa ___ menos energía que antes.","translation":"At home we use less energy than before.","options":["gastamos","gastar","reciclar","contaminar"]},"answer":"gastamos","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Gastar is used for money, but also for water and energy: gastar energía = to use energy. We: gastamos.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-gastar","es-la-energia"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":2,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"reciclar","options":["reciclar","contaminar","dudo que","el plástico"]},"answer":"reciclar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-reciclar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":3,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “el voluntario” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"el voluntario","options":["volunteer","to recycle","to protect","to use up"]},"answer":"volunteer","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-el-voluntario"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":4,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Answer in Spanish","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"¿Crees que la gente recicla lo suficiente?","translatio