es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-la-energia"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":8,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “dudo que” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"dudo que","options":["I doubt that","nature","the environment","trash"]},"answer":"I doubt that","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-dudo-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":9,"type":"complete_word","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Write the whole word","payload":{"type":"complete_word","masked":"g_s_a_","hint":"to use up"},"answer":"gastar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":20,"words":["es-gastar"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-rev2","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"The street was cleaned by the community."},"answer":"La calle fue limpiada por la comunidad.","accepted_answers":["La comunidad limpió la calle.","La calle fue limpiada por la comunidad"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-la-comunidad"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":1,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-mercado","document":"description","setting":"An article in a local newspaper in Bogotá.","lines":["En un barrio de Bogotá hay un mercado diferente: acá no se usa plástico.","El mercado fue creado hace tres años por los vecinos del barrio.","No se venden bolsas: cada cliente trae sus bolsas y sus botellas.","El café, el pan y el queso se venden sin plástico.","Los vecinos están contentos: ahora hay mucha menos basura en el barrio.","Sin embargo, para algunos clientes, los precios son altos.","«No creo que sea más caro. Solo es diferente», dice Marta, una vecina.","Ahora la comunidad quiere abrir dos mercados más en la ciudad."]},"question":"What is special about the market in Bogotá?","options":["No plastic is used and customers bring their own bags","Everything is cheaper than in other markets","It only sells coffee","It was created by the city"]},"answer":"No plastic is used and customers bring their own bags","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The article says “acá no se usa plástico” and “no se venden bolsas: cada cliente trae sus bolsas y sus botellas”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":2,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-mercado","document":"description","setting":"An article in a local newspaper in Bogotá.","lines":["En un barrio de Bogotá hay un mercado diferente: acá no se usa plástico.","El mercado fue creado hace tres años por los vecinos del barrio.","No se venden bolsas: cada cliente trae sus bolsas y sus botellas.","El café, el pan y el queso se venden sin plástico.","Los vecinos están contentos: ahora hay mucha menos basura en el barrio.","Sin embargo, para algunos clientes, los precios son altos.","«No creo que sea más caro. Solo es diferente», dice Marta, una vecina.","Ahora la comunidad quiere abrir dos mercados más en la ciudad."]},"question":"Why are the neighbors happy?","options":["There is much less trash in the neighborhood","Prices are lower","There are three new markets","The city created the market"]},"answer":"There is much less trash in the neighborhood","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The article says “Los vecinos están contentos: ahora hay mucha menos basura en el barrio”. The community wants to open two more markets, but they don’t exist yet.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-radio","setting":"A radio presenter in Monterrey talks to a man who organizes recycling in his neighborhood.","speakers":[{"name":"Diana","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rodrigo","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Diana","text":"Buenos días, Monterrey. Hoy hablamos del reciclaje. Está con nosotros Rodrigo, que organiza el reciclaje en su barrio."},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Gracias, Diana. En mi barrio se recicla mucho más que hace dos años."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y cómo se hace? ¿Qué se recicla?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Se separa la basura en casa: el papel, el vidrio y el plástico van en bolsas diferentes."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Y quién lleva todo eso a reciclar?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Los sábados, los vecinos llevan las bolsas a la plaza y un camión se las lleva."},{"speaker":"Diana","text":"¿Qué es lo más difícil?"},{"speaker":"Rodrigo","text":"Las fiestas. Se usa mucho plástico y la gente no separa nada. Tenemos que reciclar también ese día."}]},"question":"What happens on Saturdays in Rodrigo’s neighborhood?","options":["The neighbors take the bags to the square and a truck takes them away","There is a party in the square","The neighbors separate the trash at home","Rodrigo talks about recycling on the radio"]},"answer":"The neighbors take the bags to the square and a truck takes them away","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rodrigo says “Los sábados, los vecinos llevan las bolsas a la plaza y un camión se las lleva”. The trash is separated at home; on Saturdays the bags are taken to the square.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u9-jornada","document":"sign","setting":"A poster at a community center in Puebla.","lines":["¡El bosque necesita voluntarios!","El sábado 14 de marzo, de 8 a 13 horas, vamos a limpiar el bosque del barrio.","El año pasado, el bosque fue limpiado por 200 voluntarios y se plantaron 300 árboles.","Este año se van a plantar 500 árboles más.","Puede venir toda la familia: los niños van con sus papás.","Por favor, trae tu botella de agua: en el bosque no se usa plástico.","Organiza la comunidad del barrio. ¡Te esperamos!"]},"question":"Who organizes the day in the forest?","options":["The neighborhood community","The city","A school","A group of children"]},"answer":"The neighborhood community","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The poster ends with “Organiza la comunidad del barrio”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Dudo que se recicle todo el plástico.","options":["Dudo que se recicle todo el plástico.","Creo que se recicla todo el plástico.","Dudo que se recicle todo el papel.","Dudo que se recicle toda la basura."]},"answer":"Dudo que se recicle todo el plástico.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-dudo-que","es-el-plastico"]},{"id":"es-b1-u09-l05-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u09-l05","position":6,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"no creo que","right":"I don't think that"},{"left":"dudo que","right":"I doubt that"},{"left":"proteger","right":"to protect"},{"left":"contaminar","right":"to pollute"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words"