lover in reported speech. Llover is impersonal (there is no subject, like “it rains”), so iba stays singular.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-explico-que"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-rev2-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-rev2","position":7,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"fire"},"answer":"el incendio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-incendio"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-rev2-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-rev2","position":8,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"What does “me preguntó si” mean?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"me preguntó si","options":["asked me if","to happen","storm","government"]},"answer":"asked me if","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["es-me-pregunto-si"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-rev2-e09","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-rev2","position":9,"type":"complete_word","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Write the whole word","payload":{"type":"complete_word","masked":"e_ t_s_i_o","hint":"witness"},"answer":"el testigo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":20,"words":["es-el-testigo"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-rev2","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Translate into Spanish","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"The witness said that the fire was very big."},"answer":"El testigo contó que el incendio era muy grande.","accepted_answers":["La testigo contó que el incendio era muy grande.","El testigo dijo que el incendio era muy grande.","La testigo dijo que el incendio era muy grande.","El testigo explicó que el incendio era muy grande.","El testigo contó que el incendio fue muy grande.","El testigo dijo que el incendio fue muy grande."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-el-testigo","es-conto-que","es-el-incendio"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e01","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":1,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u10-reunion","document":"message","setting":"Inés writes to her colleague Pablo, who missed a meeting.","from":"Inés","to":"Pablo","lines":["Hola, Pablo. Te cuento lo que pasó en la reunión de hoy.","La jefa explicó que el proyecto era muy importante para el cliente.","Contó que el cliente vendría a la oficina el lunes.","También dijo que íbamos a trabajar en equipo toda la semana.","Me preguntó si tú podías presentar el proyecto el lunes. Le dije que no sabía.","Y me pidió que te mande el archivo de la reunión: te lo mando esta noche.","Según ella, la fecha límite es el viernes. ¡Hablamos mañana!"]},"question":"When is the client coming to the office?","options":["On Monday","On Friday","Tomorrow","Next week"]},"answer":"On Monday","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Inés writes “Contó que el cliente vendría a la oficina el lunes”: vendrá → vendría. Friday is the deadline.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e02","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":2,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Read and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"es.stim.b1-u10-reunion","document":"message","setting":"Inés writes to her colleague Pablo, who missed a meeting.","from":"Inés","to":"Pablo","lines":["Hola, Pablo. Te cuento lo que pasó en la reunión de hoy.","La jefa explicó que el proyecto era muy importante para el cliente.","Contó que el cliente vendría a la oficina el lunes.","También dijo que íbamos a trabajar en equipo toda la semana.","Me preguntó si tú podías presentar el proyecto el lunes. Le dije que no sabía.","Y me pidió que te mande el archivo de la reunión: te lo mando esta noche.","Según ella, la fecha límite es el viernes. ¡Hablamos mañana!"]},"question":"What did the boss ask Inés to do?","options":["Send Pablo the file from the meeting","Present the project on Monday","Call the client","Work alone all week"]},"answer":"Send Pablo the file from the meeting","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Inés writes “me pidió que te mande el archivo de la reunión: te lo mando esta noche”. Presenting the project is what the boss asked about Pablo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":50,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e03","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u10-testigo","setting":"A journalist talks to a woman who saw a fire in a factory in Monterrey.","speakers":[{"name":"Sergio","voice":"a"},{"name":"Gloria","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Sergio","text":"Buenos días, señora. Soy periodista. ¿Usted vio el incendio de la fábrica?"},{"speaker":"Gloria","text":"Sí, vivo enfrente. A las seis de la mañana vi mucho humo y llamé a los bomberos."},{"speaker":"Sergio","text":"¿Y qué le preguntaron los bomberos?"},{"speaker":"Gloria","text":"Me preguntaron si había personas en la fábrica. Yo no sabía."},{"speaker":"Sergio","text":"¿Y había alguien?"},{"speaker":"Gloria","text":"No, por suerte. Un señor de la fábrica me contó que todos llegan a las ocho."},{"speaker":"Sergio","text":"¿Y ahora qué tiene que hacer la gente del barrio?"},{"speaker":"Gloria","text":"Un bombero me pidió que cierre las ventanas y que no salga de casa hoy."},{"speaker":"Sergio","text":"Muchas gracias por su tiempo, señora."}]},"question":"Why was nobody in the factory?","options":["The fire was at six and everybody arrives at eight","It was a Sunday","The firefighters closed it","The workers were on a trip"]},"answer":"The fire was at six and everybody arrives at eight","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Gloria saw the smoke “a las seis de la mañana”, and a man from the factory “me contó que todos llegan a las ocho”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e04","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and answer","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"es.stim.b1-u10-radio","setting":"A radio news program: the presenter talks to a reporter in Veracruz.","speakers":[{"name":"Laura","voice":"a"},{"name":"Tomás","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.95,"lines":[{"speaker":"Laura","text":"Buenas tardes. Estas son las noticias del día. Una tormenta muy fuerte llegó anoche a Veracruz. Desde allá nos informa Tomás."},{"speaker":"Tomás","text":"Gracias, Laura. Sí, llueve desde anoche y hay agua en muchas calles del centro. Por suerte, todas las personas están bien."},{"speaker":"Laura","text":"¿Y qué dice el gobierno del estado?"},{"speaker":"Tomás","text":"El gobierno anunció que hoy no hay clases en las escuelas. Según el pronóstico, va a llover hasta el jueves."},{"speaker":"Laura","text":"¿Y el aeropuerto?"},{"speaker":"Tomás","text":"Hoy no hay vuelos. El primer vuelo sale mañana a las diez, si no llueve mucho."},{"speaker":"Laura","text":"Muchas gracias, Tomás. Vamos a informar más en las noticias de la noche."}]},"question":"When is the first flight from Veracruz?","options":["Tomorrow at ten, if it doesn’t rain much","Today at ten","On Thursday","Tonight"]},"answer":"Tomorrow at ten, if it doesn’t rain much","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Tomás says “Hoy no hay vuelos. El primer vuelo sale mañana a las diez, si no llueve mucho”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e05","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Listen and choose what you hear","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Según el periódico, el incendio ocurrió anoche.","options":["Según el periódico, el incendio ocurrió anoche.","Según el periódico, el incendio ocurrió ayer.","Según la radio, el incendio ocurrió anoche.","Según el periódico, la tormenta llegó anoche."]},"answer":"Según el periódico, el incendio ocurrió anoche.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-segun","es-el-incendio","es-ocurrir"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e06","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":6,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Match each word with its meaning","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"me preguntó si","right":"asked me if"},{"left":"me pidió que","right":"asked me to"},{"left":"anunciar","right":"to announce"},{"left":"el titular","right":"headline"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["es-me-pregunto-si","es-me-pidio-que","es-anunciar","es-el-titular"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e07","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":7,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete the sentence","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"El gobierno ___ que las escuelas iban a abrir el lunes.","translation":"The government announced that the schools were going to open on Monday.","options":["anunció","anunciar","ocurrió","según"]},"answer":"anunció","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A reporting verb in the preterite: anunció que… And the verb after it moves back: van a abrir → iban a abrir.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["es-anunciar","es-el-gobierno"]},{"id":"es-b1-u10-l05-e08","lesson_id":"es-b1-u10-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Put the words in order","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["El","periodista","me","preguntó","dónde","vivía"],"translation":"The journalist asked me where I lived."},"answer":"El periodista me preguntó dónde vivía.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words"